---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Overview from '../components/Overview';
import { currentData } from '../lib/data';
const { release, index } = await currentData();
---
<Shell title="Find a model for the task"><div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Local models. Real tasks.</h1><p class="lede">Find a model for your work. Compare the results. Inspect the answers.</p></div><div><a href="/heatmap/">Explore the heatmap →</a><br/><a class="edition-link" href="/editions/">{index.checkpoints.length} models · Edition {release.release_id.slice(8,16)}</a></div></div><Overview data={index} releaseId={release.release_id} client:load/><p class="footnote">{new Set(index.questions.filter(q=>q.scoring_status==='primary').map(q=>q.source_id)).size} primary questions across {new Set(index.suites.map(s=>s.family_id)).size} categories. Scoring revisions remain separate. Local timings describe the benchmark machine; scores describe these tested setups. Campaign started {index.campaign_created_at.slice(0,10)}.</p></Shell>
